{"id":"qEKkIDEdsnQoQkxa","meta":{"instanceId":"5fe5cf874269efd6d21f38c8c512b6a542872f9bd3b13daf40b8a3576b20e772","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"Timesheet Extractor - multiple files","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"6c672a9a-27d7-469b-a22b-e5cfd461abb6","name":"Get binaries out of chat","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[208,192],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Dieses Item enthält alle PDFs im binary-Objekt\nconst binary = $input.item.binary || {};\n\n// Wir machen aus jeder Binary-Property ein eigenes Item\nconst items = [];\n\nfor (const key of Object.keys(binary)) {\n  items.push({\n    json: {\n      fileKey: key,\n    },\n    binary: {\n      data: binary[key], // Wir normalisieren alles auf \"data\"\n    },\n  });\n}\n\nreturn items;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"74cf3f84-1680-498f-9e23-409d8885c60d","name":"Extract data from pdfs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile","position":[416,192],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"pdf"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"437911cc-84d8-4fc7-a1cd-5f80d880fdbc","name":"When chat message received","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger","position":[-16,192],"webhookId":"8fce4e3c-a294-45c9-b3d1-6297d7904493","parameters":{"options":{"allowFileUploads":true}},"typeVersion":1.4},{"id":"2ccf498c-6662-4af3-a14e-9874513204df","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-64,32],"parameters":{"width":624,"height":400,"content":"- When chat message received: Open the chat and upload one or more PDF timesheets. File uploads are enabled in the trigger options.\n\n- Get binaries out of chat: All uploaded files arrive in a single item. This Code node splits them so each PDF becomes its own item under the binary key `data`.\n\n- Extract data from pdfs: Converts each PDF into plain text, which is passed on to the AI Agent.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"77dc3318-81c2-4802-b30f-c6605bc234ed","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[592,-80],"parameters":{"color":"#E77F1D","width":480,"height":512,"content":"\n\nAI Agent: Reads the timesheet text and classifies every entry as onsite, remote, or unknown. It returns a JSON object with the consultant's name and total hours per category.\n\n\nCompanion: language model used by the agent. You can swap it for OpenAI, Anthropic, or another model.\n\n\nJSON Parser: Parses the agent's text output into clean JSON fields. It stops the workflow with a clear error if the model returns invalid JSON."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"762fb61a-a1b9-4243-b218-6e1c7968cbdc","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1088,32],"parameters":{"color":"#DB7E24","width":384,"height":400,"content":"\nAppend timesheet data to sheet: Adds one row per timesheet to your Excel workbook in Microsoft 365 (columns: name, onsite, remote, unknown).\n\n\nInsert row: Saves the same result to an n8n Data Table. This keeps a history for reporting inside n8n.\n"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"11e670e9-ac04-4aec-a516-f5676dd2d1e5","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1504,32],"parameters":{"width":368,"height":400,"content":"Sends an Outlook email once all timesheets are processed.\n"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ddb6dd11-17f7-4756-897d-2f36072f4083","name":"JSON Parser","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[944,192],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Alle eingehenden Items holen\nconst items = $input.all();\n\n// Für jedes Item die AI-Ausgabe parsen\nconst newItems = items.map(item => {\n  const raw = item.json.output || item.json.data || item.json.result;\n\n  let parsed;\n  try {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n  } catch (error) {\n    throw new Error(\n      'AI output is not valid JSON: ' +\n        error.message +\n        '\\nOutput was:\\n' +\n        raw\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Falls das geparste Ergebnis ein Array ist (z.B. [ {...} ]),\n  // nimm das erste Element – ansonsten das Objekt selbst\n  if (Array.isArray(parsed) && parsed.length === 1) {\n    parsed = parsed[0];\n  }\n\n  return {\n    json: parsed,\n  };\n});\n\n// Alle neuen Items zurückgeben\nreturn newItems;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"5e1c3f7b-69a9-48a4-b37f-8f94ed886e5e","name":"Timesheet Analyzer Agent","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","position":[592,192],"parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.text }}","options":{"systemMessage":"You are an expert for timesheets in consulting projects.\nYour only task is to analyze the provided timesheet text (converted from a PDF) and calculate total onsite, remote, and unknown hours.\n\nReturn only a valid JSON object in this format:\n\n{\n\"name\": <string>,  \n\"onsite_hours\": <number>,\n  \"remote_hours\": <number>,\n  \"unknown_hours\": <number>,\n  \n  ]\n}\n\nRules:\n- Use numbers for hours (no strings).\n- If date is missing, use null.\n- Respond with JSON only, no additional text."},"promptType":"define"},"typeVersion":3.1},{"id":"07874de8-d6fa-42c4-9a98-791d2924dc4b","name":"Insert time recordings","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","position":[1328,176],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"name":"={{ $json.name }}","onsite":"={{ $json.onsite }}","remote":"={{ $json.remote }}","unknown":"={{ $json.unknown }}"},"schema":[{"id":"name","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"name","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"onsite","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"onsite","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"remote","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"remote","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"unknown","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"unknown","defaultMatch":false}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"4eKyTPr6K3zHfN2A","cachedResultUrl":"/projects/DMuIPHIvra1eSxCb/datatables/4eKyTPr6K3zHfN2A","cachedResultName":"Timesheet"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"2d06e173-bd3b-4c40-90fc-e99660a6cae0","name":"Send a message with excel time sheet ","type":"n8n-nodes-base.microsoftOutlook","position":[1632,176],"webhookId":"5512e27e-7be4-429e-b307-5f0a6b51d70f","parameters":{"subject":"timesheet auswertung fertig","bodyContent":"=fertig ","toRecipients":"you@example.com","additionalFields":{}},"credentials":{"microsoftOutlookOAuth2Api":{"id":"Yk7dnrJ8F2QJOKwT","name":"Microsoft Outlook OAuth2 API"}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"4944c37e-5fc0-4cd8-935a-0bc1f2fe239b","name":"Append timesheet data to sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.microsoftExcel","position":[1136,176],"parameters":{"options":{},"fieldsUi":{"values":[{"column":"name","fieldValue":"={{ $('JSON Parser').item.json.name }}"},{"column":"onsite","fieldValue":"={{ $('JSON Parser').item.json.onsite_hours }}"},{"column":"remote","fieldValue":"={{ $('JSON Parser').item.json.remote_hours }}"},{"column":"unknown","fieldValue":"={{ $('JSON Parser').item.json.unknown_hours }}"}]},"resource":"worksheet","workbook":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"014RVSRQ3UGTY7DVUERJFYFUGDB7USV2L6","cachedResultUrl":"https://ppiagde-my.sharepoint.com/personal/tobias_doebber_ppi_de/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BF1F13474-84D6-4B8A-82D0-C30FE92AE97E%7D&file=Timesheet_template.xlsx&action=default&mobileredirect=true&DefaultItemOpen=1","cachedResultName":"Timesheet_template"},"operation":"append","worksheet":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"{298639D1-745A-49FD-9395-E66A44FEAF58}","cachedResultUrl":"https://ppiagde-my.sharepoint.com/personal/tobias_doebber_ppi_de/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BF1F13474-84D6-4B8A-82D0-C30FE92AE97E%7D&file=Mappe1.xlsx&action=default&mobileredirect=true&DefaultItemOpen=1&activeCell=working%20hours!A1","cachedResultName":"working hours"}},"credentials":{"microsoftExcelOAuth2Api":{"id":"jWyHv7XTwwNHECmf","name":"Microsoft Excel account 31"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"75db52d2-4541-4629-bd27-8d8951ff291d","name":"Companion Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAzureOpenAi","position":[608,352],"parameters":{"model":"gpt-5","options":{}},"credentials":{"azureOpenAiApi":{"id":"pI4qBoZBP1dRtFHM","name":"PPI Companion"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"db4fa241-f163-49d8-9f75-9e294a05cf4f","name":"Sticky Note - Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-656,-528],"parameters":{"color":"#FAE505","width":544,"height":884,"content":"## Extract consultant hours from PDF timesheets to Excel and an n8n Data Table\n\nUpload PDF timesheets in the n8n chat and get onsite, remote, and unknown hours per consultant, written to Excel and an n8n Data Table.\n\n## Who's it for\nProject managers, consulting teams, and controlling staff who collect timesheets as PDFs and want to stop typing hours into spreadsheets by hand.\n\n## How it works\n1. Upload one or more PDF timesheets in the chat.\n2. Each PDF becomes its own item and is converted to plain text.\n3. An AI agent classifies every entry as onsite, remote, or unknown and returns the consultant's name with total hours per category as JSON.\n4. One row per timesheet is appended to an Excel worksheet and saved to an n8n Data Table.\n5. An Outlook email confirms that processing is finished.\n\n## How to set up\n1. Add credentials for the chat model, Microsoft Excel, and Microsoft Outlook.\n2. Create an Excel workbook with the columns `name`, `onsite`, `remote`, `unknown` and select it in the Excel node.\n3. Create a Data Table with the same four columns and select it in the Insert row node.\n4. Enter your own email address in the Outlook node.\n5. Open the chat, upload a test PDF, and check the result.\n\n## Requirements\n- n8n version with Data Tables\n- Account for an OpenAI-compatible or Azure OpenAI model\n- Microsoft 365 account for Excel and Outlook\n- PDFs with a text layer (scanned files need OCR first)\n\n## How to customize\n- Swap the chat model for OpenAI, Anthropic, or another provider.\n- Adjust the categories in the AI Agent system prompt.\n- Replace Excel and Outlook with Google Sheets and Gmail.\n\nAI results can contain errors. Review the extracted hours before using them for billing."},"typeVersion":1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"e4d4a2b9-422d-409f-b19a-63a7d09f2e69","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"JSON Parser":{"main":[[{"node":"Append timesheet data to sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Companion Model":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Timesheet Analyzer Agent","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Extract data from pdfs":{"main":[[{"node":"Timesheet Analyzer Agent","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Insert time recordings":{"main":[[{"node":"Send a message with excel time sheet ","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get binaries out of chat":{"main":[[{"node":"Extract data from pdfs","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Timesheet Analyzer Agent":{"main":[[{"node":"JSON Parser","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When chat message received":{"main":[[{"node":"Get binaries out of chat","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Append timesheet data to sheet":{"main":[[{"node":"Insert time recordings","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}